  "text": "(n) Qualified military base realignment and closure fringe For purposes of this section— (1) In general The term “qualified military base realignment and closure fringe” means 1 or more payments under the authority of section 1013 of the Demonstration Cities and Metropolitan Development Act of 1966 ( 42 U.S.C. 3374 ) (as in effect on the date of the enactment of the American Recovery and Reinvestment Tax Act of 2009). (2) Limitation With respect to any property, such term shall not include any payment referred to in paragraph (1) to the extent that the sum of all of such payments related to such property exceeds the maximum amount described in subsection (c) of such section (as in effect on such date).",
