  "text": "(e) Taxes of shareholder paid by corporation Where a corporation pays a tax imposed on a shareholder on his interest as a shareholder, and where the shareholder does not reimburse the corporation, then— (1) the deduction allowed by subsection (a) shall be allowed to the corporation; and (2) no deduction shall be allowed the shareholder for such tax.",
