  "text": "(b) Organizational expenditures defined The term “organizational expenditures” means any expenditure which— (1) is incident to the creation of the corporation; (2) is chargeable to capital account; and (3) is of a character which, if expended incident to the creation of a corporation having a limited life, would be amortizable over such life.",
