  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(g) Special rule for applying subsections (e) and (f) In applying subsections (e) and (f) for purposes of sections 422(a)(2) and 423(a)(2), there shall be substituted for the term “employer corporation” wherever it appears in subsections (e) and (f) the term “grantor corporation” or the term “corporation issuing or assuming a stock option in a transaction to which section 424(a) applies”, as the case may be.",
