  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(b) Exceptions (1) Farming business Paragraphs (1) and (2) of subsection (a) shall not apply to any farming business. (2) Qualified personal service corporations Paragraphs (1) and (2) of subsection (a) shall not apply to a qualified personal service corporation, and such a corporation shall be treated as an individual for purposes of determining whether paragraph (2) of subsection (a) applies to any partnership. (3) Entities which meet gross receipts test Paragraphs (1) and (2) of subsection (a) shall not apply to any corporation or partnership for any taxable year if such entity (or any predecessor) meets the gross receipts test of subsection (c) for such taxable year.",
