  "text": "(b) Special rule for trusts The term “unrelated trade or business” means, in the case of— (1) a trust computing its unrelated business taxable income under section 512 for purposes of section 681; or (2) a trust described in section 401(a), or section 501(c)(17), which is exempt from tax under section 501(a); any trade or business regularly carried on by such trust or by a partnership of which it is a member.",
