  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(b) Trusts acquiring United States beneficiaries If— (1) subsection (a) applies to a trust for the transferor’s taxable year, and (2) subsection (a) would have applied to the trust for his immediately preceding taxable year but for the fact that for such preceding taxable year there was no United States beneficiary for any portion of the trust, then, for purposes of this subtitle, the transferor shall be treated as having income for the taxable year (in addition to his other income for such year) equal to the undistributed net income (at the close of such immediately preceding taxable year) attributable to the portion of the trust referred to in subsection (a).",
