  "text": "(d) Inventory items For purposes of this subchapter, the term “inventory items” means— (1) property of the partnership of the kind described in section 1221(a)(1), (2) any other property of the partnership which, on sale or exchange by the partnership, would be considered property other than a capital asset and other than property described in section 1231, and (3) any other property held by the partnership which, if held by the selling or distributee partner, would be considered property of the type described in paragraph (1) or (2).",
