  "text": "(g) Special rule where substantial diminution of risk (1) In general If paragraph (2) applies to any property for any period, the running of the period set forth in subsection (f)(1)(C) with respect to such property shall be suspended during such period. (2) Property to which subsection applies This paragraph shall apply to any property for any period during which the holder’s risk of loss with respect to the property is substantially diminished by— (A) the holding of a put with respect to such property, (B) the holding by another person of a right to acquire such property, or (C) a short sale or any other transaction.",
