  "text": "(a) S corporation defined (1) In general For purposes of this title, the term “S corporation” means, with respect to any taxable year, a small business corporation for which an election under section 1362(a) is in effect for such year. (2) C corporation For purposes of this title, the term “C corporation” means, with respect to any taxable year, a corporation which is not an S corporation for such year.",
