  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(c) Special rules For purposes of subsections (a) and (b)— (1) Joint and several liability If more than one person is liable under any paragraph of subsection (a) or (b) with respect to any one act of self-dealing, all such persons shall be jointly and severally liable under such paragraph with respect to such act. (2) $20,000 limit for management With respect to any one act of self-dealing, the maximum amount of the tax imposed by subsection (a)(2) shall not exceed $20,000, and the maximum amount of the tax imposed by subsection (b)(2) shall not exceed $20,000.",
