  "text": "(c) Nominee reporting Any person who holds an interest in a partnership as a nominee for another person— (1) shall furnish to the partnership, in the manner prescribed by the Secretary, the name and address of such other person, and any other information for such taxable year as the Secretary may by form and regulation prescribe, and (2) shall furnish in the manner prescribed by the Secretary such other person the information provided by such partnership under subsection (b).",
