  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(j) Special rules for nonresident aliens In the case of a nonresident alien described in section 6072(c): (1) Payable in 3 installments There shall be 3 required installments for the taxable year. (2) Time for payment of installments The due dates for required installments under this subsection shall be determined under the following table: In the case of the following required installments: The due date is: 1st June 15 2nd September 15 3rd January 15 of the following taxable year. (3) Amount of required installments (A) First required installment In the case of the first required installment, subsection (d) shall be applied by substituting “50 percent” for “25 percent” in subsection (d)(1)(A). (B) Determination of applicable percentage The applicable percentage for purposes of subsection (d)(2) shall be determined under the following table: In the case of the following required installments: The applicable percentage is: 1st 22.5 2nd 45 3rd 67.5 4th 90.",
