  "sourceUrl": "https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/26/6707A",
  "ingestedAt": "2026-06-27T00:00:00Z",
  "text": "(a) Imposition of penalty Any person who fails to include on any return or statement any information with respect to a reportable transaction which is required under section 6011 to be included with such return or statement shall pay a penalty in the amount determined under subsection (b).",
